<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Enhance operational safety and reliability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Enhance operational safety and reliability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Boost safety with powerful protection functions. Achieve strong availability even under extreme environmental conditions. Rely on conformal coating for a robust design that protects your operations for continuous performance.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify device handling and software use" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify device handling and software use</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Handle devices and software easily with a user-friendly design. Access the device quickly and securely via a standard web browser. View all information and diagnostic data, including vector diagrams and single-line pages.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Ensure robust cybersecurity compliance" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Ensure robust cybersecurity compliance</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Meet NERC CIP and BDEW Whitepaper cybersecurity requirements. Leverage robust cybersecurity features such as role-based access control and protocolling security-related events for a trustworthy operational environment.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Utilize modular structure for flexible solutions" id="G_Utilize%20modular%20structure%20for%20flexible%20solutions-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Utilize%20modular%20structure%20for%20flexible%20solutions-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Utilize%20modular%20structure%20for%20flexible%20solutions-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Utilize%20modular%20structure%20for%20flexible%20solutions-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Utilize modular structure for flexible solutions</h3><div id="G_Utilize%20modular%20structure%20for%20flexible%20solutions-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>The SIPROTEC 7SK85 offers future-oriented solutions for protection, control, automation and monitoring. Adjust and expand I/O quantity within the modular SIPROTEC 5 system, adding 1/6 expansion modules for adaptable functionality.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Configure comprehensive motor protection functions" id="G_Configure%20comprehensive%20motor%20protection%20functions-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Configure%20comprehensive%20motor%20protection%20functions-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Configure%20comprehensive%20motor%20protection%20functions-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Configure%20comprehensive%20motor%20protection%20functions-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Configure comprehensive motor protection functions</h3><div id="G_Configure%20comprehensive%20motor%20protection%20functions-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Configure and combine DIGSI 5 functions as needed. Implement motor protection: startup time monitoring, thermal overload for stator and rotor, unbalanced-load. Detect all ground faults in electrical power systems.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Detect ground faults of any type" id="G_Detect%20ground%20faults%20of%20any%20type-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Detect%20ground%20faults%20of%20any%20type-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Detect%20ground%20faults%20of%20any%20type-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Detect%20ground%20faults%20of%20any%20type-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Detect ground faults of any type</h3><div id="G_Detect%20ground%20faults%20of%20any%20type-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Detect ground faults in compensated or isolated electrical power systems using the following functions: 3I0&gt;, V0&gt;, transient ground fault, cos φ, sin φ, harmonic, dir.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I-en-US.json" page-id="BVde7sRLOrAzuFReMqg4y" container="comp-4WvJaNUxXUl6cq1XuFXO6I"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='7DycEyhynQqbUjJd6vgptr' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_4' data-ste-section-id='7DycEyhynQqbUjJd6vgptr'>
